  "lines": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Okay... look in your closet. That old PC? It's not junk. It's your new cloud!",
      "start": 0.09,
      "end": 6.1,
      "regions": [
        0,
        1,
        2,
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Your photos... your files... your movies... all living at home. Not on someone else's computer.",
      "start": 6.43,
      "end": 12.36,
      "regions": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Setting it up? Plug in a USB stick, turn it on... and just scan the code with your phone!",
      "start": 12.96,
      "end": 18.45,
      "regions": [
        5,
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "No keyboard. No commands. No account.",
      "start": 18.84,
      "end": 21.88,
      "regions": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Add two drives, and JenerOS keeps two copies of everything. Lose a drive? Nothing's lost.",
      "start": 22.6,
      "end": 29.94,
      "regions": [
        8,
        9,
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Updates go onto a second copy of the system. If one ever fails... it just rolls back.",
      "start": 30.56,
      "end": 35.71,
      "regions": [
        11,
        12
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "And your own app store is on the way!",
      "start": 36.22,
      "end": 38.22,
      "regions": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "Oh, and the best part? No paid tier. No disk limits. No user limits.",
      "start": 38.62,
      "end": 44.98,
      "regions": [
        14,
        15,
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "It runs on the PC you already have. That's one less computer in a landfill.",
      "start": 45.29,
      "end": 50.38,
      "regions": [
        17,
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "JenerOS. Free. Open source. Yours.",
      "start": 51.39,
      "end": 57.38,
      "regions": [
        19,
        20,
        21,
        22
      ]
    }
  ],
